msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 9（DroneCAN），作为辅助 GPS 时"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mrobotics-location-one-gps.rst:31
#: 78af6d916c8a4e649518e088ceef04fe
msgid ""
":ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` set bit 5 (+32 to value) to enable LED "
"as notification LED"
msgstr ":ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` 设置第 5 位（值加 32）以启用 LED 作为通知 LED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mrobotics-location-one-gps.rst:32
#: d4dfeb84fdbe4b8ab92217649789b206
msgid ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT<BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = 1 enables this, and any other, "
"safety switch in the system. (``BRD_SAFETYENABLE`` in older firmware "
"versions)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT<BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = 1 可启用此安全开关及系统中任何其他安全开关。（旧版固件中为 "
"``BRD_SAFETYENABLE``）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mrobotics-location-one-gps.rst:35
#: e74fe1364d5d4178818a8c6cc1817984
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mrobotics-location-one-gps.rst:37
#: f323e74cccf3463e919959736c80fd1c
msgid ""
"If your autopilot has more than 3 compasses connected, you should disable or"
" change the priority on the least important one to allow this compass to be "
"used. Even then, you may wish to prioritize this compass higher than others,"
" or as the highest priority compass, due to its improved performance. See "
"Compass Advanced Configuration page."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控已连接超过 3 "
"个罗盘，应禁用或降低最不重要的一个的优先级，以便该罗盘能被使用。由于其性能更优，你可能还希望将该罗盘的优先级设置为高于其他罗盘，甚至设为最高优先级。请参阅罗盘高级配置页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mrobotics-location-one-gps.rst:40
#: cef5aa743a124f028d25a0202d47a25a
msgid ""
"If you have any issues getting these devices recognized and used, follow the"
" instructions on enabling the CANBUS in the :ref:`common-canbus-setup-"
"advanced` page, followed by :ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` steps."
msgstr ""
"如果在识别和使用这些设备时遇到问题，请按照 :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` 页面中的 CAN 总线启用说明，以及"
" :ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` 步骤进行操作。"

